MIFM1's changes to fm1-base (base/) and its felucca-bsp (base/bsp/), applied by tools/patch_base.sh before a build.
The USB audio input's channels given by the app (FELUCCA_UAC_SOURCE): past two (FELUCCA_UAC_CH, FM1B_UAC_CH: the
four tracks and the effects' return, 10 channels, set aside; tools/uac_multi_test.c), or two (FM1B_UAC_APP: the
master mix without the metronome, a margin under full scale; tools/uac_stereo_test.c), at 44.1 or 48 kHz (the
host's choice; at 48 the app's own resampled frames, FELUCCA_UAC_SOURCE48: no uac_fir.h); two halves more in hand
(FELUCCA_UAC_DEEP 2); the packets paced evenly (uac_pace: the extra frame one at a time, not in bursts);
plat_usb_audio_info, the stream's rate and what the host lost.

diff --git a/device/plat_fm1.c b/device/plat_fm1.c
